      "text": "The present case is a civil miscellaneous appeal under Section 178 of the Motor Vehicles Act,\n1988 preferred by the National Insurance Company Limited against the award dated 23.03.2022 passed by the Motor Accidents Claim Tribunal, Jammu in file No. 74/Claim whereby a compensation of an amount of Rs. 13,19,600/-/- along with the interest @ 7.5% per annum w.e.f from the date of filing of claim petition on 01.05.2015 has been awarded in favour of respondents National Insurance Co. Ltd vs Radha Devi & Ors on 8 July, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/77593785/\n1 No. 1 and 2.\n03.",
